@lilitkarapetyan - I _think_ that a tidier version of this would be to create two instances of `DbProviderInterface`.  One implements PouchDb, and the other implements RavenDb.

They would be created in separate files, and each one will only know about its own database API.

This `index.tsx` file would create an instance of the specified DbProviderInterface.
